==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ˈtansəl&#x334;}}
*: {{rhymes|ɒnsəl}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|tonsill|lang=la}}, compare French {{term|tonsille|lang=fr}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{anatomy|immunology}} Either of a pair of small [[mass]]es of [[lymphoid]] [[tissue]] that lie on each side of the [[throat]] and that help [[protect]] the body against [[infection]].

====Synonyms====
* [[tonsilla]]

====Hyponyms====
